  "body": "This aligns HTML with the conclusion in\nhttps://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/2632 that elements with CSS `display: contents` should be focusable just like normally-rendered elements.  It fixes a piece of #1837.\n\n- [X] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * [X] Chromium **support**, see [crbug.com/1366037](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1366037) and [crrev.com/c/3910374](https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/3910374)\n   * [X] Gecko **positive**, see mozilla/standards-positions#772\n   * [x] WebKit (see WebKit/standards-positions#164 for context)\n- [X] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n   * [crrev.com/c/3910374](https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/3910374) or web-platform-tests/wpt#39247 (but if you comment on the latter, please call my attention to it since it's an automatic-export issue\n- [X] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n   * Chromium: [crbug.com/1366037](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1366037)\n   * Gecko: [bug 1553549](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1553549) and [bug 1791648](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1791648)\n   * WebKit: [bug 255149](https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=255149)\n- [ ] [MDN issue](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) is filed: …\n\n(See [WHATWG Working Mode: Changes](https://whatwg.org/working-mode#changes) for more details.)\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/9425/interaction.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 31, 2024, 3:49 PM UTC (5b75526)\">/interaction.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/9425/d911ba3...5b75526/interaction.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 31, 2024, 3:49 PM UTC (5b75526)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/9425/rendering.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 31, 2024, 3:49 PM UTC (5b75526)\">/rendering.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/9425/d911ba3...5b75526/rendering.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 31, 2024, 3:49 PM UTC (5b75526)\">diff</a> )",
